<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{$subject}</title>
<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 30px;
    font: 12pt Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;
}
article {
    border: 2px solid #222d32;
    padding: 2px;   
}
header {
    font-size: 20pt;
    padding: 0.5em;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: white;
    background: no-repeat center right #222d32 url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
    background-size: auto 70%;
    background-position-x: calc(100% - 0.5em);
}
main {
    padding: 1em;
}
footer {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    border-top: 1px solid #cbd9dc;
    padding: 1em;
    position: relative;
}
footer img {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1em;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
}
a {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #595959;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<article>
<header>{$subject}</header>
<main>{$message|noescape}</main>
<footer>
{if $showSettingsInfo}
<p>Pokud nechcete dostávat tento typ oznámení, upravte prosím svoje nastavení uživatelského účtu.</p>
{/if}
Programujte s radostí, <a href="{$footerUrl}">Váš ReCodEx</a>
<a href="{$githubUrl}" target=_blank><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Github"></a>
</footer>
</article>
</body>
</html>
